 "notes": [
  "Columns follow the row order within each panel: (a) confabulation (reported as fabrication), misclassification (factual error), both, none or unclear; (b) generative, discriminative, both, unclear. 120 stratified critical records; 12 title-only records excluded. Failure mode: Cohen κ 0.57 (95% CI 0.46-0.69), Gwet AC1 0.60 (95% CI 0.49-0.71), raw agreement 69.4% (75/108; 95% CI 59.8%-77.9%), κ_max 0.755. Model type: Cohen κ 0.84 (95% CI 0.74-0.93), Gwet AC1 0.88 (95% CI 0.81-0.94), raw agreement 90.7% (98/108; 95% CI 83.6%-95.5%). Fabrication-involved disagreements (model yes, human no vs the reverse): 20 vs 1 (model fabrication-involved 42/108; human 23/108)."
